## How
ffprobe; full decode; ebur128; silencedetect; blackdetect; 16 frames (`qc/cut-v3-contact.jpg`); tonal and transient measurement (`qc/cut-v3-sound-measure.txt`). audio-understanding returned HTTP 429 again, so I have not heard this mix through a model. The ear check rests on the screening.

## Results
