- S3: no voice in any earlier listen; no voice layer was added since.
- P1: title plate, 5 shots, end plate.
- P2: "The Paper Lantern" crisp at 1.5 s.
- P3: "The End" readable at 20.0 s.
- P4 pass: child with the lantern (3.5–6.4); hands drawn back and lantern floating free (6.6–9.9); lantern drifting past the village (10.1–13); child watching (15.0); a tiny warm light on the horizon among the stars (17.2, 18.2).
